<LanguageData>
  <VQE_ArcSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!-- EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] has occupied the location of an abandoned ARC generator site. The camp is under the control of [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] is requesting that we clear out the area by eliminating all enemies and defenses. Once the site is secured, we will have the opportunity to study the ARC generator and recover valuable ARC components. [asker_label] also says that [sitePart0_description]. -->
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] de [asker_faction_name], nos mandou uma mensagem. Um grupo de [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] ocupou o local de um gerador ARC abandonado. O acampamento está sob o controle de [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] pede que limpemos a área eliminando todos os inimigos e defesas. Com o lugar seguro, teremos a chance de estudar o gerador ARC e recuperar componentes ARC valiosos. [asker_label] diz também que [sitePart0_description].</li>
    <!-- EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;We have received information that an old ARC generator site has been taken over by [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] from [siteFaction_name]. The bandits have fortified their position and are using the location as a hideout.\n\nSecuring the site will allow us to examine the generator for any remaining research data and salvageable ARC components. Be prepared for resistance, as the site is likely heavily guarded. Additionally, [sitePart0_description]. -->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;Soubemos que o local de um velho gerador ARC foi tomado por [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] de [siteFaction_name]. Os bandidos fortificaram a posição e usam o lugar como esconderijo.\n\nTomar o lugar nos permitirá examinar o gerador atrás de dados de pesquisa e componentes ARC aproveitáveis. Prepare-se para resistência: o lugar deve estar bem guardado. Além disso, [sitePart0_description].</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;the site is partially overgrown, with many of its original structures crumbling from age -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;o lugar está meio tomado pelo mato, com muitas das estruturas originais caindo de velhas</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;the bandits have fortified the site with makeshift defenses and traps -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;os bandidos fortificaram o lugar com defesas improvisadas e armadilhas</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;the ARC generator is visibly damaged but still holds valuable salvage -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;o gerador ARC está visivelmente danificado, mas ainda tem sucata valiosa</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;the site appears to be a mix of old ruins and hastily built bandit encampments -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;o lugar parece uma mistura de ruínas antigas com acampamentos de bandidos montados às pressas</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;hostile patrols have been seen guarding the perimeter -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;patrulhas hostis foram vistas guardando o perímetro</li>
    <!-- EN: sitePart0_description-&gt;the bandits are using the generator to power their crude operations -->
    <li>sitePart0_description-&gt;os bandidos estão usando o gerador para alimentar as suas operações toscas</li>
  </VQE_ArcSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
